DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45300::$$$message_0415_0000_0000$$$::"Well, that puts an end to that."::
45301::$$$message_0415_0000_0001$$$::"I didn't think an onsen would really fix the problem..."::
45302::$$$message_0415_0000_0002$$$::"A magic onsen that grants wishes... To think something like this actually exists..."::
45303::$$$message_0415_0000_0003$$$::"Never doubt my intuition. Be captivated by my beautiful skin and voice! [wvl][hfwww layer=2]Ohh ho ho ho ho!"::
45304::$$$message_0415_0000_0004$$$::"Was that a Luvia impression?"::
45305::$$$message_0415_0000_0005$$$::"It's unpleasant to hear."::
45306::$$$message_0415_0000_0006$$$::"Rrgh. I expected you to say it doesn't sound like her, but that's harsh."::
45307::$$$message_0415_0000_0007$$$::"Still, magical or not, this is a nice onsen. I feel like it's making my skin all smooth."::
45308::$$$message_0415_0000_0008$$$::"Maybe it's an alkaline spring. If so, the reason your skin feels smoother is because of the proteins in the alkaline water permeating your skin[line len=2]"::
45309::$$$message_0415_0000_0009$$$::"Yeah, yeah. Can we not have a science lecture while we're enjoying a bath?"::
45310::$$$message_0415_0000_0010$$$::"This is an onsen that grants wishes. It's also good for your skin. Let's leave it at that."::
45311::$$$message_0415_0000_0011$$$::"Yeah, my skin's as smooth as a baby's bo...[wvl canskip=false time=400][hfsweat layer=2 ox=-130 oy=50]bot...tom?"::
45312::$$$message_0415_0000_0012$$$::"Ch-Chloe?"::
45313::$$$message_0415_0000_0013$$$::"A-are you okay, Chloe!? You're not overheating, are you!?"::
45314::$$$message_0415_0000_0014$$$::"Huh? I'm fine, what do you mean?"::
45315::$$$message_0415_0000_0015$$$::"B-but you're all red...!"::
45316::$$$message_0415_0000_0016$$$::"Red? Let me see... I'm not red at all. Actually, I'm kinda green."::
45317::$$$message_0415_0000_0017$$$::"Wait, why am I green!?"::
45318::$$$message_0415_0000_0018$$$::"Whoa! You're like a space alien!"::
45319::$$$message_0415_0000_0019$$$::"W-what is going on!?"::
45320::$$$message_0415_0000_0020$$$::"Ah, thank goodness, I'm back to my normal col[line len=2]wait, now my voice is weird!"::
45321::$$$message_0415_0000_0021$$$::"It sounds way thicker!"::
45322::$$$message_0415_0000_0022$$$::"I thought this onsen was supposed to grant wishes!"::
45323::$$$message_0415_0000_0023$$$::"A wish-granting onsen..."::
45324::$$$message_0415_0000_0024$$$::"...Chloe. What did you wish for when you got into the bath?"::
45325::$$$message_0415_0000_0025$$$::"Huh? I asked for my color and voice back, obviously."::
45326::$$$message_0415_0000_0026$$$::"What about you, Illya?"::
45327::$$$message_0415_0000_0027$$$::"I-I wished for Chloe's color and voice to go back to normal..."::
45328::$$$message_0415_0000_0028$$$::"So did I."::
45329::$$$message_0415_0000_0029$$$::"...Hold on. Don't tell me..."::
45330::$$$message_0415_0000_0030$$$::"All three of our wishes overlapped...and combined?"::
45331::$$$message_0415_0000_0031$$$::"Most likely."::
45332::$$$message_0415_0000_0032$$$::"That..."::
45333::$$$message_0415_0000_0033$$$::"That's crazy!!!"::
45334::$$$message_0415_0000_0034$$$::"You're really scary when you yell with that voice and color!"::
45335::$$$message_0415_0000_0035$$$::"You're...an ogre..."::
45336::$$$message_0415_0000_0036$$$::"Cancel! Cancel your wishes! You two need to take it back!"::
45337::$$$message_0415_0000_0037$$$::"I-I'm not sure it's that simple..."::
45338::$$$message_0415_0000_0038$$$::"...(This is starting to become a hassle.)"::
45339::$$$message_0415_0000_0039$$$::"Waaaah! Why is this happening to me!?"::
45340::$$$message_0415_0000_0040$$$::"Now now, don't cry, Elder."::
45341::$$$message_0415_0000_0041$$$::"Who are you calling Elder!?"::
45342::$$$message_0415_0000_0042$$$::"...(I just want to go home and eat dinner.)"::
45343::$$$message_0415_0000_0043$$$::"Urh, I've had it! Why does this always happen to me!?"::
45344::$$$message_0415_0000_0044$$$::"Moral of the story: be careful what you wish for! Right?"::
45345::$$$message_0415_0000_0045$$$::"Of..."::
45346::$$$message_0415_0000_0046$$$::"...course not!!!"::
45347::$$$message_0415_0000_0047$$$::"...! (Seeing a shooting star, she makes a wish.)"·Œ·?